      <trans-unit id="extensionList.removalConfirmation.question" approved="yes">
        <source>Removing the extension deletes its source files but the related database tables and data will remain unchanged. Please perform a database update to ensure integrity.</source>
        <target state="final">ການລຶບສ່ວນເສີມຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງມັນອອກ ແຕ່ຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ກະລຸນາເຮັດການອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕ້ອງຄົບຖ້ວນ.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="dependencyCheck.unresolvedDependencies.title" approved="yes">
        <source>Please read this carefully before proceeding</source>
        <target state="final">ກະລຸນາອ່ານຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕໍ່</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="dependencyCheck.unresolvedDependencies.message" approved="yes">
        <source><![CDATA[
          <p>If you continue activating the extension, all dependency checks will be turned off.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Required extensions are tried to be fetched from TER (if they do not yet exist in the system)</li>
            <li>Version dependency checks are skipped</li>
          </ul>
          <strong>
            Be aware that activating an extension without dependency checks may turn your TYPO3 installation unusable. In such a case manual intervention is required.
          </strong>
				]]></source>
        <target state="final"><![CDATA[
          <p>ຖ້າທ່ານດຳເນີນການເປີດໃຊ້ສ່ວນເສີມຕໍ່, ການກວດສອບການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປິດ.</p>
<li>ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຈະຖືກພະຍາຍາມດຶງມາຈາກ TER (ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ)</li>
<li>ການກວດສອບການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນຂອງເວີຊັນ ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ</li>
